      "voiceId": "patrick-bet-david",
      "voiceName": "Patrick Bet-David",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "You know you live in the greatest country in the world, when the loudest critics still choose to stay.\n\nThere\u2019s no place like \ud83c\uddfa\ud83c\uddf8. \n\nHowever, it\u2019ll take every ounce of fight by the next generation to keep it great.",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/patrickbetdavid/status/2047491736914575786",
      "timestamp": "2026-04-24T01:44:05+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "patrick-bet-david",
      "voiceName": "Patrick Bet-David",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Leaders don\u2019t just create followers, but they create  leaders.\n\nIf others replicate what you do. day in and day out, would they win?",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/patrickbetdavid/status/2047336694190653883",
      "timestamp": "2026-04-23T15:28:00+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "patrick-bet-david",
      "voiceName": "Patrick Bet-David",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Great news.\n\nEight Iranian women protesters who were scheduled to be executed tonight will now be spared.\n\nThink about that for a moment, \na world where a U.S. president has to ask another country (IRGC) to show mercy to eight women.\n\nRespect to the President.\n\n\nThe White House (@WhiteHouse)\n\n\u201cVery good news! I have just been informed that eight women protestors who were going to be executed tonight in Iran will no longer be killed\u2026\u201d - President Donald J. Trump \ud83c\uddfa\ud83c\uddf8\n\n\n\n\n\n\u2014 https://nitter.net/White",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/patrickbetdavid/status/2047014226267353521",
      "timestamp": "2026-04-22T18:06:37+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "patrick-bet-david",
      "voiceName": "Patrick Bet-David",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "You either control your imagination or your imagination controls you.\n\nIf you let it loose, it can cause constant stress and anxiety.",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/patrickbetdavid/status/2046943603977851046",
      "timestamp": "2026-04-22T13:26:00+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "patrick-bet-david",
      "voiceName": "Patrick Bet-David",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "The great @ArmanUfc.  \n\nNot only a great fighter but \u201clow key\u201d a strong backgammon player.\n\nFuture looks bright!",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/patrickbetdavid/status/2046746793765949572",
      "timestamp": "2026-04-22T00:23:57+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "patrick-bet-david",
      "voiceName": "Patrick Bet-David",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Future leader of Poland.   \ud83d\udc47\ud83c\udffd\n\n\nDominik Tarczy\u0144ski MEP (@D_Tarczynski)\n\nAlmost two hours on one of America\u2019s biggest shows!\n\nWe covered mass migration, \u201crefugees\u201d raping goats and sheep in Europe, Qatargate, President Trump, but most of all, about my beautiful Poland! \n\nThank you @patrickbetdavid and I look forward to hosting you in Warsaw! \ud83c\uddf5\ud83c\uddf1\ud83c\uddfa\ud83c\uddf8\n\n\n\n\n\n\u2014 https://nitter.net/D_Tarczynski/status/2046611439696130071#m",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/patrickbetdavid/status/2046745503627374721",
      "timestamp": "2026-04-22T00:18:49+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
