      "voiceName": "Patrick Bet-David",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "No matter what you do, you\u2019ll be criticized.\n\nWin, they call you greedy.\nLose, they call you lazy.\n\nSo stop performing for them.\nPick a noble path you can live with.\n\nYou won't win over all your critics! EVER! \n\nDo you!",
